IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-S13.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-NUM PIC S9(3)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE -12.34 TO OUT-NUM
    OPEN OUTPUT OUT-FILE
    DISPLAY OUT-STATUS
    IF OUT-STATUS = "00"
        WRITE OUT-REC
        DISPLAY OUT-STATUS
        CLOSE OUT-FILE
        DISPLAY OUT-STATUS
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
